# This repo tracks the web app: its source (next/), the built app that the site serves from this
# folder (index.html, assets/, favicon.svg, manifest.json, sw.js) and the research pictures
# (images/). Everything else in the working folder stays local.
#
# To publish a change: cd next && npm run release, then commit and push.

# The app before the rewrite, kept on this machine only. It is also in git history up to 38afdcc.
v1_backup/

# The build before it is copied up to this folder. Regenerated by every build.
v2/

# Docs — reference material, not served by the app. Local only.
CLAUDE.md
PRODUCT.md
APPS_SCRIPT_CHANGES.md

# Google Apps Script backend — pasted into the Apps Script editor by hand.
# Both files hardcode live Finnhub API keys (KEY1/KEY2), so neither is ever committed.
# apps-script.gs is the stale pre-multi-portfolio copy; apps_script.js is canonical.
apps_script.js
apps-script.gs

# Local tooling
.claude/
.impeccable/

# Stray shell artifacts
git push origin main.txt
*.tmp
